OL,3,APolice officers discovered Chloe
OL,4,AMitchell's remains in bins, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article contains details that some
OL,7,Fmay find distressing
OL,9,FPolice and forensics officers have told
OL,10,Fa court how they discovered the
OL,11,Fdismembered remains of Chloe Mitchell
OL,12,Fin bins.
OL,14,FBrandon Rainey, formerly of James
OL,15,FStreet in Ballymena, is on trial
OL,16,Faccused of murdering Chloe and
OL,17,Fpreventing the lawful burial of her
OL,18,Fremains, which he denies.
